            /*
             * ---------------------------------------------------------
             * CONTACT
             * ---------------------------------------------------------
             *
             * Contact Form uses deferred binding.
             *
             * formId remains empty so a missing Form Builder or database
             * row cannot break deployment.
             *
             * When Form Builder is added, create the standard form with:
             *
             * key: contact-form
             * name: Contact Form
